      "content": "It's understandable why these persistent issues are causing you concern. Flickering lights and an always-on thermostat can definitely be unsettling when they happen without any apparent reason. While it's possible these are simple malfunctions or firmware bugs, you could try power cycling the devices or checking for software updates first. If the behavior continues and you remain uneasy, considering a professional home technology check is a wise step.",
      "source": "target",
